## Why This Is Asked

Assess ability to architect a real-time, multi-tenant streaming gateway with strict delivery guarantees, policy enforcement, and resilience under failure scenarios.

## Key Concepts

- Real-time streaming and exactly-once processing
- Per-tenant policy evaluation and data locality
- Backpressure, circuit breakers, and fault isolation
- Multi-variant routing (base, tuned, safety-guarded)
- Chaos engineering and testability

## Code Example

```javascript
// processPrompt(tenantId, prompt) -> Promise<Response>
async function processPrompt(tenantId, prompt) {
  const policy = await policyService.get(tenantId);
  if (!policy.allow) throw new Error('Policy denied');
  const variant = selectVariant(tenantId, prompt, policy);
  return router.streamPrompt(tenantId, prompt, variant);
}
```

